[99.476186, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ CLI plan reads labels on later pages and retries rate limits \u001b[90m(230.880616ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[99.812479, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ CLI list and gc recognize label-owned resources \u001b[90m(338.872634ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[100.172636, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ CLI teardown deletes branch resources in dependent-first order only \u001b[90m(360.08243ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[100.361927, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ CLI refuses teardown if another branch genuinely depends on it \u001b[90m(191.352966ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[100.370835, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ envctl preserves case-insensitive label keys before shared normalization \u001b[90m(4.069446ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ normalization preserves tags, defaults, and explicit tag precedence \u001b[90m(0.30316ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ plans include label-only dependents and volumes, but not similar branch names \u001b[90m(0.41894ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ genuine external label-only dependents still block teardown \u001b[90m(0.344152ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ selectors parse key=value \u001b[90m(1.551592ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ resources group by branch tag \u001b[90m(0.190608ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ summary warns about untagged resources \u001b[90m(0.434653ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ plan includes untagged resources created by the branch's stack \u001b[90m(0.352514ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ plan deletes dependents before the resources they depend on \u001b[90m(0.293562ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mℹ tests 13\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mℹ suites 0\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mℹ pass 13\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mℹ fail 0\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mℹ cancelled 0\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mℹ skipped 0\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mℹ todo 0\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mℹ duration_ms 1279.647482\u001b[39m\r\n"]
